    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "KM Property is delighted to present to the market 18 Tuscany Park. This attractive home offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation throughout and provides an excellent balance of comfortable living space, privacy and outdoor enjoyment.\n\nViewing Video: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TVhQ_VIOLWk\n\nInternally the accommodation has been thoughtfully upgraded and comprises; entrance hallway, living room with feature fireplace, an open plan kitchen/dining room and sunroom. This additional space creates a versatile additional living space that is ideal for relaxing, entertaining or enjoying views of the garden throughout the year. Upstairs three bedrooms and an upgraded shower room complete the accommodation.\n\nOutside to the from the front a driveway accommodates off street parking. Side pedestrian access leads to the rear garden. An EV charger has also been installed at the side pedestrian entrance. The south facing is predominantly laid in lawn, with paving and offers a tranquil space to relax and unwind.\n\nThe location is a major attraction. Tuscany Park is situated in Baldoyle, Dublin 13, within easy reach of a wide range of everyday amenities and transport links. The property is conveniently positioned for Baldoyle village, local shops, schools, recreational facilities and the seafront, making it particularly attractive to families and those who enjoy coastal living. Bayside DART Station is also within walking distance, providing convenient rail connections towards Dublin city and beyond. There are also excellent public transport links to and from Dublin City Centre by bus."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ENTRANCE HALLWAY - 1.6m (5'3\") x 4.5m (14'9\")\nThe hallway has access to under stairs storage, Laminate flooring.\n\nLIVING ROOM - 3.15m (10'4\") x 4.5m (14'9\")\nThe living room is set overlooking the front garden and has a feature built in stove. Glazed double doors open through to the kitchen/dining room. Laminate flooring.\n\nKITCHEN/DINING ROOM - 2.9m (9'6\") x 4.9m (16'1\")\nThe open plan kitchen/dining space is flooded with natural light. The kitchen is fitted with a range of wall and floor units. There is a well-appointed dining area that offers an ideal space to entertain. This room opens directly out to the sun room and rear garden.\n\nSUNROOM - 2.1m (6'11\") x 4.13m (13'7\")\nA great addition to any home this area offers an ideal space to relax and unwind. There is direct access from here out to the rear garden.\n\nLANDING - 1.9m (6'3\") x 3.15m (10'4\")\nThe landing has access to a hot press for storage. A pull down stairs provides access to the attic offering an ideal space for further storage.\n\nBEDROOM ONE - 2.95m (9'8\") x 3.15m (10'4\")\nGenerous double bedroom with upgraded built in wardrobes.\n\nBEDROOM TWO - 2.45m (8'0\") x 2.6m (8'6\")\nBright and spacious double bedroom with built in wardrobes.\n\nBEDROOM THREE - 2.4m (7'10\") x 2.5m (8'2\")\nWell appointed single bedroom with built in wardrobes.\n\nSHOWER ROOM - 1.7m (5'7\") x 1.9m (6'3\")\nThis space is fully tiled and fitted with a wc, whb and walk in shower. A window allows for natural light and ventilation.\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> GAS FIRED CENTRAL HEATING </li><li> BRIGHT AND SPACIOUS INTERIOR </li><li> UPGRADED KITCHEN </li><li> UPGRDAED SHOWER ROOM </li><li> SUN ROOM </li><li> OFF STREET PARKING </li><li> SIDE PEDESTRIAN ACCESS </li><li> SOUTH FACING REAR GARDEN </li><li> C ENERGY RATING </li><li> EV CHARGING POINT</li></ul>"
      },
